== Recent changes ==
The full changelog is on the [[:en:User:Alaexis/AI Source Verification#Change Log|English Wikipedia page]]. Highlights:

* '''September 2026''' – Hebrew interface and right-to-left support; choice of claim scope (sentence or paragraph) in Settings.
* '''August 2026''' – French, Spanish and Russian interfaces; explanations written in the wiki's language on every wiki; quotations from the source shown alongside verdicts; feedback moved on-wiki; redesigned sidebar.
* '''July 2026''' – Wikimedia LiftWing models added; PDF upload for offline sources; adjacent citations checked together.
* '''June 2026''' – "Not supported" split into ''omission'' and ''contradiction''; more reliable Internet Archive fetching.

